localdiscord (1.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * P2P LAN chat with X25519 ECDH + AES-256-GCM end-to-end encryption.
  * Automatic peer discovery via UDP broadcast and mDNS (zeroconf).
  * Discord-inspired dark-theme PyQt6 user interface.
  * Text channels and private messaging support.

 -- Your Name <you@example.com>  Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
